  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have learned to tolerate certain threats to the point where they no longer bother you.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose a number of poisons or diseases equal to your Constitution modifier. You become immune to those specific poisons or diseases.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> This feat can be selected multiple times, each time selecting an additional number of poisons or diseases.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/arcforge-feats#toc0\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
